wandb/
*.log
*.pt          # NEVER check in model files (checkpoints live on /mnt/d, outside the repo)
# RAW-RESULTS POLICY: result data (jsonl/csv/md/tex) under results/<bench>/ IS checked in — the
# rows hold run_ids + metrics only, verified free of secrets (no IPs/tokens/gcp-ids/keys). Only
# model files (*.pt) are excluded. results/ is tracked by default (intentionally NOT listed here).
# Commit result data once a run completes — not a churning mid-sweep snapshot.
# Legacy live dirs below are operational churn; their data migrates to results/<bench>/ post-run.
fleet_results/*
!fleet_results/.gitkeep
lm_results/*
!lm_results/.gitkeep
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.venv/
# external LM harness (on shelf) — kept locally, add as submodule when LM goes live
rola_bench/lm/flame/
